{
  "id": "section-railways-table",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "section-railways-table:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Railways table (d6)\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[53,22,42]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-railways-table:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "1\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[53,42,44]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-railways-table:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "As you walk down the tracks, you are chased by a demonic\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[53,44,101]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-railways-table:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "creature in a clown mask. Save vs. L4 to Escape (add +1 for\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[53,101,161]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-railways-table:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Slippery Skill, +2 if you have it at Expert level). If you fail, you take\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[53,161,235]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-railways-table:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "1 damage and must fight. If you have the CLOWNFACE keyword,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[53,235,295]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-railways-table:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you may avoid this encounter with a successful L4 Charisma roll\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[53,295,359]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-railways-table:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "(the -1 modifier from a clown mask or a scarred face do not\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[53,359,419]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-railways-table:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "apply to this specific roll).\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[53,419,449]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-railways-table:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Demonic Clown, L5 demon, 4 Life, Damage 1. The Demonic\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[53,449,504]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-railways-table:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Clown has a 2 in 6 chance of ignoring any hit you inflict on him\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[53,504,569]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-railways-table:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "unless you are using a magic weapon (roll d6 for every hit you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[53,569,632]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-railways-table:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "inflict, and on a 1 or 2 the wound is ignored).\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[53,632,680]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-railways-table:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "If you defeat the clown, you gain 1 XP. You may move away from\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[53,680,743]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-railways-table:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "this area or unmask him by playing event #13.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[53,743,789]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-railways-table:p0015",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "2\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[53,789,791]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-railways-table:p0016",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You notice something interesting next to an abandoned train.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[53,791,852]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-railways-table:p0017",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Roll on the Random Objects table. You may take this object if\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[53,852,914]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-railways-table:p0018",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you want.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[53,914,924]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-railways-table:p0019",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "3 Random encounter. Roll d6 to determine which table to use : 1\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[53,924,988]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-railways-table:p0020",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Undead, 2 Beast, 3-4 Slasher, 5 Possessed, 6 Demonic Horrors.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[53,988,1050]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-railways-table:p0021",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "4\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[53,1050,1052]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-railways-table:p0022",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You enter an abandoned train to explore it. The inside is\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[53,1052,1110]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-railways-table:p0023",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "scrawled with ominous graffiti. Someone named WALRUS has\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[53,1110,1167]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-railways-table:p0024",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "signed the graffiti in red paint. Gain 1 Clue.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[53,1167,1214]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-railways-table:p0025",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "5\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[53,1214,1216]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-railways-table:p0026",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You enter a train to explore it. A few seconds later, the train\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[53,1216,1280]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-railways-table:p0027",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "starts to move. If you rush out, play event #14 from the list of\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[53,1280,1345]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-railways-table:p0028",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "events at the end of this book. If you remain on the train, play\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[53,1345,1410]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-railways-table:p0029",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "event #16 instead.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[53,1410,1429]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-railways-table:p0030",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "6\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[53,1429,1431]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-railways-table:p0031",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You explore a train. As you sit down to rest, a ghastly train\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[53,1431,1493]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-railways-table:p0032",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "steward appears and asks to see your ticket. If you have a train\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[53,1493,1558]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-railways-table:p0033",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "ticket, all is good and you move out as soon as the creature\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[53,1558,1619]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-railways-table:p0034",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "disappears. If you do not have a ticket, the ghost yells in your\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[53,1619,1684]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-railways-table:p0035",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "face (save vs. L4 Fear or lose 1 Sanity). The ghost then disappear.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[53,1684,1752]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-railways-table:p0036",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "If you lose your final point of Sanity here, you die of fright\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[53,1752,1815]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-railways-table:p0037",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "becoming a ghost on this train.",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[53,1815,1846]]"
    }
  ],
  "sourcePages": [
    53
  ]
}
